spans.s:
1. आ-√ श्रि P. -श्रयति, to affix;
to apply anything, AV. xi, 10, 10 :
Ā. -श्रयते, to attach one's self to;
to join, MBh.; BhP.; Kathās.; Pañcat. &c.;
to adhere, rest on Mn.; MBh.;
to betake one's self to, resort to;
to depend on;
to choose, prefer;
to be subject to, keep in mind;
to seek refuge in, enter, inhabit;
to refer or appeal to, MBh.; Kathās.; Śak.; Ragh.; Prab.; R. &c.

आ-√ श्रु P. -शृणोति Ā. -शृणुते, to listen to;
to hear;
to perceive (with the ear), RV.; AV.; TS.; ŚBr.; BhP. &c.;
to accept, promise, Pāṇ. i, 4, 40; R.; Yājñ.; L. :
Caus. -श्रावयति [but आ॑-श्रवयतम्, RV. vii, 62, 5; aor. -अशुश्रवुस्, RV. x, 94, 12],
to cause to hear;
to announce, make known, tell, RV.; ĀśvŚr.; MBh.;
to address, speak to, call to (especially at particular rites), RV.; AV.; TS.; ŚBr.; ChUp.; TUp.; KātyŚr. &c.:
Desid. -शुश्रूषति [only P. Pāṇ. i, 3, 59], to wish to hear;
to listen.

1. आ-√ स्रु P. -स्रवति, to flow near or towards;
to flow, stream, flow from, BhP.; Sarvad.;
to spring a leak;
to flow off, go off, deteriorate, AV. v, 19, 8; ii, 29, 7 :
Caus. -स्रावयति and -स्रवयति, to cause to flow;
to bleed, cup, Kām.;
to impel, Sarvad.
